690 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We used the purpose of the stay to surface potentially relevant room and service choices\056 A visual room offered a concrete way to discuss arrangements that an assistant might not otherwise think to request\056 We kept a review step so that a selected option could be checked before submission\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 691 0 R
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

691 0 obj
  << /K [ 690 0 R ]
     /P 716 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

692 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We set aside an all\055guest\054 all\055property solution\056 The focused segment and urban context made the design more manageable\054 but limit how widely our conclusions can travel\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 693 0 R
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

693 0 obj
  << /K [ 692 0 R ]
     /P 716 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

694 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We did not pursue exhaustive mandatory questions or interaction for its own sake\056 Skipping\054 saying \215not needed\216 and keeping a trusted human channel remain necessary design conditions\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 695 0 R
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

695 0 obj
  << /K [ 694 0 R ]
     /P 716 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

696 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We treated purpose as a starting point rather than a complete description of a guest\056 The assistant interview challenged our early business\055versus\055leisure generalisation\072 familiarity with the guest and the service relationship can matter more than trip category\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 697 0 R
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

697 0 obj
  << /K [ 696 0 R ]
     /P 716 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

698 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We did not propose replacing the hotel\220s core property system\056 Any production version would need an agreed connection to existing records and task handling\056 That integration is unresolved\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 699 0 R
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

