  << /ActualText (This adds a proposed workflow around situational care\056 It does not establish that MO needs its first preference database or its first SOP\056 The supplied GXP framework already includes profile information\054 traces and minimum service guidance\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 707 0 R
     /Pg 680 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
